  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding to the Clinton Health Access Initiative (CHAI) - &quot;3DSHAPE&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Funding to the Clinton Health Access Initiative (CHAI) - &quot;3DSHAPE&quot; is a component of UK investment in the Global Fund 2020-2022 to reduce transmission and mortality for HIV AIDS, tuberculosis and malaria through treatments, diagnostics and preventive technologies and related services reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;17,320,242. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): STD control including HIV/AIDS, Malaria control, Basic health care, Tuberculosis control.</narrative>
  </description>
